          <div class="education">
            <h2>Educational Qualifications</h2>
            <article class="education-row">
              <img
                src="/images/nus-logo.webp"
                alt="National University of Singapore crest"
                width="64"
                height="72"
                loading="lazy"
              />
              <div>
                <h3>
                  National University of Singapore (NUS)
                </h3>
                <p class="date">2023-2027</p>
                <p>
                  I am currently pursuing a Bachelor of Computing in Computer
                  Science (Honours) at NUS. My expected graduation year is 2027.
                  I won't yap about it here, go to my Linkedin if you want to see more details about my education.
                </p>
